# IANA backzone (almanac-sourced), Zimbabwe (Harare / Salisbury) -- Harare Mean Time
# (+2:04:12) until Mar 1903, then CAT (+2:00); vs default link to Africa/Maputo (+2:10:18
# LMT -> +2:00 only at 1909). Zimbabwe standardized on +2:00 six years before the default
# left LMT, so it stands ~10 min slow relative to the default across 1903-1909.
#
# NOT Shanks-page-sourced: reproduces IANA's own backzone Africa/Harare exactly (the Sierra
# Leone / Bahrain discipline). Thin sub-hour window [1903-03-01, 1909-01-01); converges with
# Maputo at CAT afterward.
# Rebuild the compiled TZif with:  rake shanks:build.  Cross-check: IANA:Africa/Harare.
Zone Shanks/ZW_1 2:04:12  -    LMT   1903 Mar
                 2:00     -    CAT
